gb-columns-2 layout-12-12 mbl-layout-stacked vgutter-10\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-half-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-b423a6aa-64b2-420b-8a5d-cd0f107cef48\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-columns advgb-columns-wrapper\" id=\"advgb-cols-81c5bcfe-0fa4-48a8-a2ec-ad6ebb29cd91\"><div class=\"advgb-columns-container\"><div class=\"advgb-columns advgb-columns-row advgb-is-mobile advgb-columns-2 layout-13-23 mbl-layout-stacked vgutter-10\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-one-third-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-008931d3-a776-431b-b83b-c8889b9a107c\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\" style=\"min-height:300px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1407\" height=\"841\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-11386\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-08-07-165848.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-08-07-165848.png 1407w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-08-07-165848-300x179.png 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-08-07-165848-1024x612.png 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-08-07-165848-768x459.png 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-08-07-165848-18x12.png 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1407px) 100vw, 1407px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-two-thirds-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-649fb42f-294c-4d0d-949e-c968e989340a\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2>Cameroon<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The AIMS Centre of Excellence in Cameroon is located in Limbe, a seaside city with its black sand beaches. A few meters from the Centre, the city features its Botanical Garden unveiling an impressive variety of fascinating plants and its Zoological Garden hosting rain forest animals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button bg-alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Visit Centre<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:35px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-columns advgb-columns-wrapper\" id=\"advgb-cols-73daebce-e7ef-44e3-a1db-18262883d9df\"><div class=\"advgb-columns-container\"><div class=\"advgb-columns advgb-columns-row advgb-is-mobile advgb-columns-2 layout-13-23 mbl-layout-stacked vgutter-10\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-one-third-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-4ea029b1-294d-42c1-ab30-6c1f21cd5f6b\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\" style=\"min-height:300px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-10724\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/07\/IMG_9472-1-scaled.jpg\" data-obje